# The whole environment of the NeMo Relay plugin's end-to-end tests. Guardrails isn't in it: nemo-relay needs
# Python 3.11 or later and a newer langchain than uv.lock pins, so the hooks servers run from the repository's .venv.
# requirements.txt pins these with hashes. Compile it from the repository root, which applies the repository's
# 7-day exclude-newer window to every package except nemo-relay, pinned exactly here:
#
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.11 --generate-hashes \
#     --exclude-newer-package nemo-relay=2026-10-21T00:00:00Z \
#     tests_relay_plugin/requirements.in -o tests_relay_plugin/requirements.txt
nemo-relay[langchain]==0.10.4
pytest
